          </div>
          <div class="routine-item-icon" style="background:rgba(245,166,35,0.12);">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5A623"><path d="M12 3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a1 1 0 1 1-2 0V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zm0 15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a1 1 0 1 1-2 0v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM4 11h1a1 1 0 0 0 0 2H4a1 1 0 0 0 0-2zm15 0h1a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h-1a1 1 0 0 0 0-2zM5.636 4.636a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l.707.707a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414l-.707-.707a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414zm12.728 12.728a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l.707.707a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414l-.707-.707a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414zm0-12.728a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-.707.707a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l.707-.707a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0zM6.343 17.657a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-.707.707a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l.707-.707a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0zM12 7a5 5 0 1 1 0 10A5 5 0 0 1 12 7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="routine-item-label">AM Cleanser &amp; Sunscreen</span>
