    <p class="legal-section-heading">1. Data Collection &amp; Storage</p>
    <p class="legal-body">This application operates strictly on a "local-first" architecture. All application states, learning progress, score logs, streak calendars, daily quest data, and checklist metrics are stored locally and exclusively inside the sandboxed hardware storage of your individual physical device. No personal identifiable data, biometric profiles, account credentials, or network logs are collected, stored, tracked, or transmitted by this software or its developers.</p>

    <div class="legal-divider"></div>

    <p class="legal-section-heading">2. Third-Party Disclosures</p>
    <p class="legal-body">We do not utilize remote server networks, cloud database buckets, advertising analytics, or user behavior tracking pixels. No data is harvested, shared, or sold to third-party entities.</p>

    <div class="legal-divider"></div>

    <p class="legal-section-heading">3. Your Rights &amp; Purging Data</p>
    <p class="legal-body">Because all application states reside entirely on your personal physical hardware, you maintain total ownership of your information. Deleting the application from your device permanently purges all stored statistics, records, and history from your system memory.</p>
  </div>
</div>

